  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0145_459822af3435.png\" style=\"width: 293px; height: 230px;\" /></p><p>To find point of intersection, eliminate <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math> from both the equation, we get<br /><br /><math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br />Area&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><munderover><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></munderover><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>&#183;</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><munderover><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></munderover><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><msubsup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfrac></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;sq. units</p>"
